  "comment": "Sig: x = finv(p, v1, v2). Inverse F CDF. Covers (v1, v2) ∈ {(1,1), (5,10), (10,30)} × p ∈ {0.05, 0.5, 0.95} + p=0 (=> 0) + p=1 (=> Inf) + p outside [0,1] (=> NaN) + v1<=0 / v2<=0 (=> NaN)."
